ms":["Architect","Spatial Designer","Experience Designer"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination creates strong pathways into interior architecture, workplace design, retail, hospitality, exhibition design, branded environments, computational design, and future immersive spatial experiences."}]}]}